<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="55.1" level="1">Property and Conveyances</unit>
		<unit label="subtitle" identifier="IV" level="2">Common Interest Communities</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="20" level="3">Horizontal Property Act</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="3" level="4">Management of Horizontal Property Regimes</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>55.1-2009</section_number>
	<catch_line>Deeds of individual apartments</catch_line>
	<text>
		The deed of each individual apartment shall express the particulars prescribed under subdivisions 1 and 2 of § 55.1-2008 relative to the apartments concerned and shall also express all encumbrances on such apartments.
	</text>
	<history>1962, c. 627, § 8, § 55-79.8; 2019, c. 712.</history>
</law>
